{"id":"d1bc049c8d","t":"The Glutton","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/download-11.jpg","n":55,"l":55,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-glutton"},"u":1795038546475,"desc":"عالمٌ دمّره ملك الشياطين. بعد أن فقد كل شيء، اتخذ المختار، سي تشن، خيارًا يائسًا لا طائل منه: تفجير نفسه ليأخذ معه أحد ملوك الشياطين – لان يو الجشع. لكنه وجد نفسه فجأةً منقولًا إلى الوراء سنواتٍ مضت، دون أن يوقع على أي شيء بعد. اكتشفت أن قدراتها ربما تكون سابقةً لعصرها، معروفةً بالفعل. ومع ذلك، عندما طلبت استخدامها، بدأ كل شيء في العالم يتغير…","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اعادة احياء","اكشن","شياطين","مغامرة","وحوش"],"src":{"ml":"the-glutton"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/16/"},"17":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/17/"},"18":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/18/"},"19":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/19/"},"20":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/20/"},"21":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/21/"},"22":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/22/"},"23":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/23/"},"24":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/24/"},"25":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/25/"},"26":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/26/"},"27":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/27/"},"28":{"ml":"the-glutton|/manga/the-glutton/28/"},"29":